-- 2026-10-20. Puppy descriptions cleaned up and their plain facts moved into the boxes on the puppy page
-- (Alex, 2026-10-19: "for all the puppy descriptions ... those need to be reviewed and cleaned up moving
-- information into the boxes where appropriate"; approved 2026-10-20 on the review page in
-- hs-seo-data/puppyconnection/2026-10-20-puppy-descriptions). Contact lines, phone numbers, links and the Wix
-- price and date header (every figure matched the stored values) leave the text, because the page shows them.
-- Sex, color, markings, registration, vaccinations, deworming, health notes, disclosures and goes-home items
-- move into their own fields, taken only from the breeder's own words. Dashes joining clauses become commas,
-- periods or parentheses. The Maple Brook Doodles demo puppies are left to the demo reset.
-- Every description update names the exact current text, every field fills only an empty value, and every
-- goes-home list names its current value, so a breeder's own edit is left alone and a second run changes
-- nothing. Run once on staging after a backup, with ops/d1-apply.mjs.

